   "summary": "He said his tractor operator, who was also abducted, was killed after his family reportedly failed to raise the ransom demanded by the kidnappers, while his own family was asked to pay ₦15 million for his release. Olaniyi said that even after his family paid the ransom, he was transferred to another group of kidnappers who demanded additional money. Despite negotiating the second ransom down to ₦2 million, he said they continued to endure unbearable conditions until an opportunity arose for them to escape.",
   "summary_zh": "他说，他的拖拉机操作员也遭到绑架，并在据称其家人未能筹集绑匪要求的赎金后被杀，而绑架他的团伙则要求他的家人支付₦1500万以换取他的释放。奥拉尼说，即使他的家人支付了赎金，他仍被移交给了另一伙绑匪，对方又索要更多钱款。尽管他将第二笔赎金谈到₦200万，他们仍继续忍受难以忍受的条件，直到逃脱机会出现。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Gbolahan Olaniyi recounts his horrific experience after he was kidnapped on his farm in Ekiti State. He said his tractor operator, who was also abducted, was killed after his family reportedly failed to raise the ransom demanded by the kidnappers, while his own family was asked to pay ₦15 million for his release. Olaniyi said that even after his family paid the ransom, he was transferred to another group of kidnappers who demanded additional money. Despite negotiating the second ransom down to ₦2 million, he said they continued to endure unbearable conditions until an opportunity arose for them to escape. He shares how he eventually regained his freedom after the ordeal. Our Reporters",
