   "summary": "LEADERSHIP gathered that the armed men invaded the farm on Sunday afternoon and abducted the women, who were associated with the Islamic school run by the teacher, identified as a Malam. Sources said the bandits had contacted the Malam and the families of the abducted women, demanding food supplies before releasing the victims. The demands have raised concerns over the safety of the women, who remain in the custody of their abductors.",
   "summary_zh": "领导层 gathered 周日下午武装人员闯入农场并绑架了数名女性，这些女性与由一名被称为Malam的教师经营的伊斯兰学校有关。消息人士称，绑架者已联系该Malam及被绑架女性的家属，要求提供食品后才释放受害者。这些要求引发了外界对女性安全的担忧，她们目前仍被绑架者控制。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "LEADERSHIP gathered that the armed men invaded the farm on Sunday afternoon and abducted the women, who were associated with the Islamic school run by the teacher, identified as a Malam. Sources said the bandits had contacted the Malam and the families of the abducted women, demanding food supplies before releasing the victims. The demands have raised concerns over the safety of the women, who remain in the custody of their abductors. When contacted, the Niger State Police Command’s Public Relations Officer, SP Wasiu Abiodun, said he would verify the details of the incident and provide further information. Further details were being awaited as of the time of filing this report. We’ve got the edge. Get real-time reports, breaking scoops, and exclusive angles delivered straight to your phone. Don’t settle for stale news. Join LEADERSHIP NEWS on WhatsApp for 24/7 updates →",
