   "title": "Tinubu concludes Saudi Arabia visit after Umrah",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/11/tinubu-concludes-saudi-arabia-visit-after-umrah/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
   "source": "vanguardngr.com",
