   "title": "Telecel rewards customer with brand new Hyundai Creta in Dream Car Promo",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/telecel-rewards-customer-with-brand-new-hyundai-creta-in-dream-car-promo/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
   "source": "MyJoyOnline（加纳）",
   "published": "Mon, 02 Nov 2026 17:13:44 +0000",
   "_dt": 1793639624.0,
   "ageDays": 0.05,
   "summary": "Telecel Ghana presented a brand-new Hyundai Creta to the grand prize winner of the 15th cycle of its Dream Car Promo, reaffirming its commitment to transforming customers' lives through rewarding, impactful experiences. The latest winner, Eric Ayamga, a security and intelligence officer and Telecel customer for more than 15 years, received the keys to his new vehicle alongside three family members.",
   "summary_zh": "Telecel Ghana向其“梦想汽车促销”活动第15期特等奖得主赠送了一辆全新的Hyundai Creta，再次彰显了公司通过有 rewards、有影响力的体验改变客户生活的承诺。最新获奖者Eric Ayamga是一名安全与情报官员，也是使用Telecel服务超过15年的客户；他在三名家庭成员的共同见证下 Receiving了新车车钥匙。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Telecel Ghana presented a brand-new Hyundai Creta to the grand prize winner of the 15th cycle of its Dream Car Promo, reaffirming its commitment to transforming customers' lives through rewarding, impactful experiences. The latest winner, Eric Ayamga, a security and intelligence officer and Telecel customer for more than 15 years, received the keys to his new vehicle alongside three family members. For Mr Ayamga, the win is the culmination of a journey that began when he first joined the promotion last year and expressed his appreciation to the telecommunications company for fulfilling its promise. \"I was motivated to take this Dream Car promo more seriously after I watched videos of the previous winner receiving his car,\" he said. \"The Dream Car Promo is real and genuine. \"As I have won today, it is a testimony, and I want to encourage everyone to also try, and they could be winning like me. I'm so excited, I can't measure it in words. Thank you very much, Telecel. I'm so grateful,\" he added. Speaking at the presentation ceremony, Carlos Asare-Okoh, Senior Manager, Mobile Data and Digital Services of Telecel Ghana, said the promotion reflects Telecel Ghana's commitment to helping customers achieve their aspirations. \"As a brand, we aim to support our customers to be able to achieve their dreams and goals in life,\" he said. \"Our promotions are intentional to impact and change the lives of our customers.\" With the 16 th cycle of the promo already underway, Mr Asare-Okoh announced a GH¢100,000 cash prize to be awarded in December, alongside the existing monthly cash rewards, giving customers even more chances to win. \"We encourage customers to keep playing and increase their chances of winning,\" he added. The promo runs in partnership with Vasmol and is regulated by the National Lottery Authority (NLA) on the Caritas Lottery platform to ensure transparency, fairness, and credibility throughout the campaign",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
   "country": [
    "gh"
   ],
   "topic": [
    "sec"
   ],
   "tier": 4,
   "actor": "第三方",
   "alsoUS": false,
   "cnHit": false,
