   "title": "Ghana must turn scientific research into practical industrial solutions",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/ghana-must-turn-scientific-research-into-practical-industrial-solutions-csir-iir-director/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
   "source": "MyJoyOnline（加纳）",
   "published": "Mon, 02 Nov 2026 16:02:52 +0000",
   "_dt": 1793635372.0,
   "ageDays": 0.1,
   "summary": "The new Director of the Council for Scientific and Industrial Research's Institute of Industrial Research (CSIR-IIR), Dr William Owusu Oduro, has called for a shift towards industry-focused scientific research, warning that innovations that fail to address manufacturers' practical needs could undermine Ghana's industrial ambitions. He says research institutions must prioritise technologies that help local businesses improve production, reduce costs and compete with imported products.",
   "summary_zh": "科学和工业研究委员会工业研究所（CSIR-IIR）新任主任威廉·奥苏苏·奥杜罗博士呼吁，科学研究应转向以工业需求为重点；他警告，无法解决制造商实际需求的创新，可能削弱加纳的工业抱负。他说，研究机构必须优先开发能够帮助本地企业提高产量、降低成本并与进口产品竞争的技术。",
   "summarySource": "index",
   "body": "The new Director of the Council for Scientific and Industrial Research's Institute of Industrial Research (CSIR-IIR), Dr William Owusu Oduro, has called for a shift towards industry-focused scientific research, warning that innovations that fail to address manufacturers' practical needs could undermine Ghana's industrial ambitions. He says research institutions must prioritise technologies that help local businesses improve production, reduce costs and compete with imported products. Delivering his inaugural address, Dr Oduro proposed an industry immersion programme that would place technical staff directly within manufacturing companies to identify operational challenges and develop practical solutions. He said the initiative would help researchers better understand the needs of businesses and produce technologies that could be adopted and commercialised, rather than remaining at the pr",
   "bodyLevel": "excerpt",
