   "title": "N. Korea denounces S Korea-US joint military drills, vows to bolster nuclear deterrent",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/northkorea/20261102/n-korea-denounces-s-korea-us-joint-military-drills-vows-to-bolster-nuclear-deterrent",
