   "title": "Kwankwaso, Yusuf: South Must Retain Power in 2027",
   "url": "https://www.thisdaylive.com/2026/11/02/kwankwaso-yusuf-south-must-retain-power-in-2027/",
   "domain": "thisdaylive.com",
   "source": "ThisDay（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Mon, 02 Nov 2026 02:26:52 +0000",
