   "summary": "By Musa Ubandawaki, Sokoto SOKOTO — Former Senator Abubakar Umar Gada has declared the Peoples Democratic Party (PDP) ready to reclaim political power in Sokoto State in 2027, following the defection of members of the All Progressives Congress (APC) and African Democratic Congress (ADC) to the party. Gada made the declaration on Saturday in Gwadabawa […] The post appeared first on Vanguard News",
   "summary_zh": "穆萨·乌班达瓦基撰稿，索科托——前参议员阿布巴卡尔·乌马尔·加达宣布，在全进步大会党（APC）和非洲民主大会（ADC）部分成员转投人民民主党（PDP）后，该党已准备好于2027年在索科托州重新夺回政治权力。加达于周六在瓜达巴瓦作出上述表示……该文章首发于Vanguard News",
